### 1. Tạo author
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/authors/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Author Test 409"
}
### 2. Tạo category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/categories/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Category Test 409"
}
### 3. Tạo book gắn đúng author_id/category_id vừa tạo
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Book Test 409",
  "year": 2024,
  "summary": "Book dùng để test chặn xóa",
  "author_id": 1,
  "category_id": 4
}

### Author đã gắn Book -> 409
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/authors/1

### Category đã gắn Book -> 409
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/categories/4

### Category không tồn tại -> 404
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/categories/9999